# Walkthrough - DineAI Ranking & Prompt Engineering Frameworks

We have successfully designed, implemented, and verified the complete **Ranking Framework** (in [ranking.py](file:///d:/data/AI_WAITER/dine_ai/retrieval/ranking.py)) and **Prompt Engineering Framework** (in [prompts.py](file:///d:/data/AI_WAITER/dine_ai/llm/prompts.py)) for the DineAI platform. Both modules conform strictly to SOLID design principles, Clean Architecture, and patterns like Builder, Strategy, and Registry.

